Package: wowordcount
Type: Package
Title: LIWC-style Word Count Analyses
Version: 0.0.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriele", "Di Cicco", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Counts words and word patterns in text documents using
    user-supplied dictionaries, in the style of LIWC. Native jamovi port of
    the WordCount application.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: jmvcore (>= 2.4), methods
Suggests: jsonlite
